First-party license status
==========================

The first-party M110 source selected for this fixture has no repository-level
license declaration in the inspected donor revision
97661c6297b3044f3855313955de21df87c54167. The sampled donor files also contain no
license identifier. This file records that unspecified status; it does not
relicense those files, grant new rights, or select an open-source license for
the generator. A first-party license decision remains with the project owner.

Third-party source retains its original copyright notices and license terms.
See THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md, dependencies.lock.json, and the license files kept
with each materialized dependency. A listed dependency may still be planned or
unresolved; its inclusion in an inventory is not evidence of an actual import.

No PathSim code is included or authorized by this file.
